# --- Ad-hoc scratch scripts in the repo root ---
# One-off investigation helpers (PII detector triage, KL divergence checks,
# INN/phone fixture generation) that several past sessions committed to the
# root. Real code lives in agent_obs/, tests/, scripts/, pilot_agent/.
#
# Patterns are root-anchored ("/") on purpose so they cannot affect anything
# under tests/ or the packages. test_*.py here is scratch, not tests: pytest
# is restricted to testpaths = ["tests"], and these files assert nothing
# (print-only), so they were never and could never provide coverage.
/debug_*.py
/check_*.py
/analyze_*.py
/create_*.py
/generate_*.py
/recalculate_*.py
/simple_*.py
/step_by_step_*.py
/test_*.py